[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=20 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="主档案没有一段连续的影像。它是许多人的交接：有人把参数抄错，后来补上；有人在页边骂电压不稳；也有人留下了一封没有寄出去的信。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "sanfrancisco", "herald"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="先看可验证的部分。时间、修改记录、谁有权限。别让最响的那句话排到最前面。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "sanfrancisco", "herald"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="这里说，重启会重新分配识别……不是把原来的人找回来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "sanfrancisco", "herald"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="sanfrancisco"

speaker_name=""

text="是。我带回去的那页，只是这份记录的结论。前面的失败、争议和中止都不在我手里。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "sanfrancisco", "herald"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="旧金山的声音从小队频道传来，偶尔被风切断。她不在这里，却没有像上一次那样先讲一段不会伤到人的话。她说她看过一部分，也承认自己没有看完。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "sanfrancisco", "herald"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="herald"

speaker_name=""

text="保存下来的东西，怎么能叫失去？只要继续运行，他们总有一天会回答。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "sanfrancisco", "herald"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="哪一句算回答？他们的，还是你一直重复给他们听的？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "sanfrancisco", "herald"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="herald"

speaker_name=""

text="你现在当然可以这么说。你什么都没失去，你只是忘了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "sanfrancisco", "herald"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="这句话刺得很准。你没法证明自己失去过谁，甚至没法证明自己有资格难过。德雷顿把手放到栏杆上，靠近你的手，却没有替你把它握住。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "sanfrancisco", "herald"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="你不知道他失去过什么。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "sanfrancisco", "herald"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="herald"

speaker_name=""

text="你也不知道。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "sanfrancisco", "herald"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="所以我不替他答应。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "sanfrancisco", "herald"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="潮痕蹲在档案箱旁边，把一张被水黏住的纸慢慢揭开。那是一份申请，申请人在“是否同意继续”下面画了很重的叉。你们都看见了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "sanfrancisco", "herald"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="我以前替她解释过这个叉。我说她是在害怕，她想清楚就会同意。我花了很久才承认，她已经说清楚了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "sanfrancisco", "herald"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="后来呢？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "sanfrancisco", "herald"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="后来没有我想要的那个后来。这个答案不好听，但我不能再换一种说法骗你。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "sanfrancisco", "herald"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把纸压平，和那张没有离开时间的名单放在一起。它们并不证明世界上所有的事，却足够让你做眼前这个决定。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "sanfrancisco", "herald"])

actor_tones={}

